        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Two panels sewn together. Worked with silk yarns in a local variation of the cross-stitch. Tapering panel embroidered with a vertical row of red and green \"glastra\" (Greek: vase) patterns and bordered with small diamond-shaped leaves; rectangular panel shows all-over pattern of stylized leaves. Some stains."@en ;
